  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "If the array has n distinct values, the number of possible permutations is n factorial.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 7020,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 211,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "3 values give only 6 permutations, but factorial growth becomes huge very quickly, and we would have to store many of those permutations.",
      "start_ms": 8080,
      "end_ms": 19320,
      "start_frame": 242,
      "end_frame": 580,
      "word_count": 23
    },
    {
      "text": "So this also breaks the constant extra space requirement.",
      "start_ms": 20400,
      "end_ms": 23900,
      "start_frame": 612,
      "end_frame": 717,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "So generating every arrangement, just to move one step forward, is doing far too much work.",
      "start_ms": 24230,
      "end_ms": 31760,
      "start_frame": 727,
      "end_frame": 953,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "We already have the current permutation.",
      "start_ms": 32360,
      "end_ms": 34660,
      "start_frame": 971,
      "end_frame": 1040,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "We should use its structure.",
      "start_ms": 35240,
      "end_ms": 36800,
      "start_frame": 1057,
      "end_frame": 1104,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Think about what next really means.",
      "start_ms": 37820,
      "end_ms": 40240,
      "start_frame": 1135,
      "end_frame": 1207,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "We want the smallest possible change.",
      "start_ms": 40660,
      "end_ms": 43200,
      "start_frame": 1220,
      "end_frame": 1296,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "That makes the array larger.",
      "start_ms": 43600,
      "end_ms": 45440,
      "start_frame": 1308,
      "end_frame": 1363,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "If we change something too far to the left, the jump becomes unnecessarily large.",
      "start_ms": 46200,
      "end_ms": 52040,
      "start_frame": 1386,
      "end_frame": 1561,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "So we should try to make the change as far to the right as possible.",
      "start_ms": 52040,
      "end_ms": 57860,
      "start_frame": 1561,
      "end_frame": 1736,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "That gives us our first clue.",
      "start_ms": 58820,
      "end_ms": 61060,
      "start_frame": 1765,
      "end_frame": 1832,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Look from the right side of the array and find the first place, where a larger arrangement is still possible.",
      "start_ms": 61860,
      "end_ms": 71580,
      "start_frame": 1856,
      "end_frame": 2147,
      "word_count": 20
    },
    {
      "text": "Now we can build the optimal idea carefully.",
      "start_ms": 72240,
      "end_ms": 75600,
      "start_frame": 2167,
      "end_frame": 2268,
      "word_count": 8
    }
  ],
